#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:114
#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:270
msgid ""
"Read the :doc:`upgrade instructions <upgrading>` and :doc:`change log "
"<../changelogs/index>`, and check Breaking Changes and Enhancements."
msgstr ":doc:`업그레이드 지침 <upgrading>` 및 :doc:`변경 로그 <../changelogs/index>`를 읽고 호환성이 중단되는 변경 사항(Breaking Changes)과 개선 사항을 확인하세요."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:118
#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:274
msgid "Upgrading to a Specified Version"
msgstr "특정 버전으로 업그레이드"

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:120
#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:276
msgid ""
"For example, you may want to upgrade from v4.4.7 to v4.4.8 after v4.5.0 "
"has been released."
msgstr "예를 들어, v4.5.0이 출시된 후 v4.4.7에서 v4.4.8로 업그레이드하고 싶을 수 있습니다."

